        "role": "assistant",
        "content_md": "To get an Anthropic API key, you'll need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Visit the Anthropic website and create an account if you don't already have one\n2. Navigate to the API section of your account\n3. Follow the instructions to generate a new API key\n\nFor complete and up-to-date information about obtaining an API key, pricing details, usage limits, and documentation, please visit:\nhttps://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/\n\nIf you have any specific questions about using the API once you have your key, I'd be happy to help with those.",
